        (r'\b(rumbling|rumble|thud|thump|impact|charge|charging|beam|projectile|energy|power up|power down|powerup|extra life|life gain|1 up|one up|level up|bonus|item get|get item|item|collect|pickup|pick up|jump|jumping|hurt|pain|damage|death|dies|die|dead|defeat|defeated|destroy|destroyed|hit|land|landing|bounce|pop|spring|transform|transformation|spawn|attack|shoot|shot|fire ball|bomb|coin|goal|checkpoint|block|stomp|bump|swing|throw|toss|fall|falling|appear|disappear|collision|crash|collapse|refill|upgrade|heal|health|hp|mp|quake)\b', 'GAMES'),
